      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "With some events being a battle to see who can get in, it would be useful for there to be ways to ENSURE staff can get into and stay in an instance. For example the lobby fills up, so you turn it to staff only so that they can leave and join as needed possibly switching shifts without bystanders taking up the space they need for staff.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
